  "source_audit_findings": [
    "No query labels, oracle or mechanism parameters enter inference. Query labels condition the offline mask generator and empirical scoring; training query labels enter only BCE.",
    "The always-observed u is sufficient for the outcome before observing masks; auxiliary x provides no additional outcome information conditional on u.",
    "Context combines engineered full-parity residual moments with a learned row encoder. It does not isolate the benefit of learning a raw-row representation.",
    "Source and target latent outcome process and class-balance intercept remain fixed within each outcome world; target policies vary.",
    "Training source/target policies are independent. Development shifts derive target policy from source. Reversal is within marginal training policy support; extreme rate/block/value parameters are held out.",
    "The no-shift ablation has matching labels, latent rows, episodes, optimizer budget and architecture; its target policy matches source during training.",
    "Pooled ridge exposes both source and target labels with domain interactions; its regularizer leaves only the final domain intercept unpenalized, penalizing the source intercept.",
    "Nominal 95% intervals average regimes within each seed. They are developmental intervals from one training seed, without confirmatory multiplicity or population-generalization claims."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Model inference and estimator fits were not independently rerun.",
    "True float64 latent u is not saved; oracle reconstruction uses float32 saved u and therefore has a small rounding tolerance.",
    "Saved row IDs are local synthetic identities; source inspection is needed to establish separate latent draws."
  ]
